  "summary": "A willing creature appears dead for 1 hour: Blinded, Incapacitated, Speed 0, resists all but Psychic damage.",
  "text": "Touch a willing creature to put it into a deathlike trance for 1 hour. To outward inspection and to spells that check its status, the target looks dead. While the spell lasts, the target has the Blinded and Incapacitated conditions and a Speed of 0, it has Resistance to all damage except Psychic damage, and it has Immunity to the Poisoned condition. Can be cast as a Ritual."
